		<div class="topic" id="forum_op_topic_563671642446777055">
		AI trash	</div>
	<div class="content" id="forum_op_content_563671642446777055">
		When will developers realise we don't want anything to do with AI in games.<br><br>You wanna make a game? Put in the effort and do it all yourself, or find someone who can. It's just lazy, stop taking shortcuts.	</div>
		
