<script type="text/javascript">
	$J( function() {
		InitializeForumTopic( {"owner":"46500940","type":"General","feature":"0","gidforum":"588439574765634901","forum_display_name":"General Discussions","forum_url":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/app\/5316540\/discussions\/0\/","forum_search_url":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/app\/5316540\/discussions\/search\/","is_public":1,"permissions":{"can_view":1,"can_post":1,"can_reply":1,"is_banned":0,"can_delete":0,"can_edit":0},"appid":5316540}, "https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/forum\/46500940\/General\/",
		"563671642446777055", {"author":"PupZival","text":"When will developers realise we don't want anything to do with AI in games.\n\nYou wanna make a game? Put in the effort and do it all yourself, or find someone who can. It's just lazy, stop taking shortcuts."}		);
			} );
</script>
										<script type="text/javascript">
$J( function() { InitializeCommentThread( "ForumTopic", "ForumTopic_103582791476022348_588439574765634901_563671642446777055", {"feature":"588439574765634901","feature2":"563671642446777055","owner":"103582791476022348","commentthreadid":"660770715","total_count":35,"start":0,"pagesize":15,"has_upvoted":0,"upvotes":0,"votecountid":null,"voteupid":null,"commentcountid":null,"subscribed":false,"extended_data":"{\"topic_permissions\":{\"can_view\":1,\"can_post\":1,\"can_reply\":1,\"is_banned\":0,\"can_delete\":0,\"can_edit\":0},\"original_poster\":62026882,\"topic_gidanswer\":\"0\",\"forum_appid\":5316540,\"forum_public\":1,\"forum_type\":\"General\",\"forum_gidfeature\":\"0\"}","oldestfirst":true,"comments_raw":{"563671642446782530":{"text":"No one cares? Dont blame the future for your personal failure","author":"Hex: Baby Legion"},"563671642446785508":{"text":"i fucking love it, im vibing with the music. not everyone can afford to buy songs from  bands you know?","author":"Christina"},"563671642446789972":{"text":"nah it's much better than the other ai slop tidy up games, I can see some effort put in this","author":"\u0410\u043b\u0435\u043a\u0441\u0430\u043d\u0434\u0440\u0430"},"563671642446796478":{"text":"[quote=PupZival]When will developers realise we don't want anything to do with AI in games.[\/quote]\nThere is no 'we'.\n\nYou might not want anything to do with AI in games (although your wording and tone scream performance, not conscientious objection) but I don't care about AI use, backend or upfront, gen or other.  \n\nI care about a fun game and this one is adorable.\n\nSo your statement is false.\n\nYou want perform anti-AI sentiment?  Put in the effort and make a rational argument instead of presumming to speak for people you don't know.  It's just lazy, stop taking shortcuts.\n\nOh, and keep harrassing devs over disclosed AI use and don't be surprised when Steam rolls back on mandating it be disclosed and bans any discussion of it.","author":"LadyIndiga"},"563671642446818135":{"text":"[quote=PupZival]When will developers realise we don't want anything to do with AI in games.\n\nYou wanna make a game? Put in the effort and do it all yourself, or find someone who can. It's just lazy, stop taking shortcuts. [\/quote]\n100% agree they can literally get royalty free songs","author":"Jinxy Jester"},"563671642446825221":{"text":"People paying money for this trash are the problem. You're just enabling developers to be more lazy and crank out more garbage.","author":"BlueCat"},"563671642446841182":{"text":"The game is like $5. The developer put a lot of effort imo. I love the vibe of this game, the music is perfect. Not everyone has a problem with AI being used. \n\nTo the developer: Beautiful job! Other Tidy Up games are reusing all the same items for their stores. This was completely different.","author":"Starburst"},"563671642446856700":{"text":"[quote=BlueCat;563671642446825221]People paying money for this trash are the problem. You're just enabling developers to be more lazy and crank out more garbage. [\/quote]\nI can't speak for everybody, but I don't personally consult a bunch of pearl-clutching, virtue-signaling, performative strangers on Steam before I spend my hard-earned money.","author":"Poof"},"563671642446871131":{"text":"Personnally I don't care about AI at all. Always suprised by the militants crying about it in every discussion page. Who cares ?","author":"77bsn77"},"563671642446874493":{"text":"WTF difference does it make if they use AI or not?  I don't see you creating anything but hate on every game forum that has anything to do with AI?  Are you a game designer out of a job, I don't think so, are you an artist in need of work?  I don't think so.  So keep your nasty remarks about AI to yourself.  You and so many other losers have tried to ruin games for all the rest of us because you are living in  the 90s, not the 2020s!!","author":"crztrucker57"},"563671642446877027":{"text":"Love to pump out low quality slop to cash in on a trend. Thats what game dev is all about!","author":"REDIC"},"563671642446877463":{"text":"You people literally cannot be pleased. You screamed for AI disclosure and this Dev very clearly disclosed every single part of their game they used AI to assist with. Do you want them to disclose it or not? You're just going to make other Devs hide their use because of this bullshit, childish behavior. You bought a game that disclosed AI use just to cry about the AI use? Or, worse yet, you're critiquing a game you never even played.\n\nTo the Dev: You made an incredible game that many of us truly enjoyed. Don't listen to these people.","author":"Skull Merchant's Wife"},"563671642446883814":{"text":"Let them have their slop games.","author":"EQOAnostalgia"},"563671642446885081":{"text":"[quote=EQOAnostalgia;563671642446883814]Let them have their slop games. [\/quote]\nLike you have an authority to stop it.\n\nI get it, the future is scary.  But being angry about it and taking out that anger on a small business isn't going to make anything better and just makes you look bitter and sad.","author":"LadyIndiga"},"563671642446885391":{"text":"[quote=Skull Merchant's Wife;563671642446877463]You people literally cannot be pleased.[\/quote]\nWe have been here before.  \n\nHopefully people will remember that and not bother trying past basic courtesy.","author":"LadyIndiga"}},"track_navigation":true}, 'https://steamcommunity.com/comment/ForumTopic/', 40 ); } );
</script>
