			<div class="commentthread_comment_text" id="comment_content_563671642446796478">
				<blockquote class="bb_blockquote with_author"><div class="bb_quoteauthor">Originally posted by <b>PupZival</b>:</div>When will developers realise we don't want anything to do with AI in games.</blockquote>There is no 'we'.<br><br>You might not want anything to do with AI in games (although your wording and tone scream performance, not conscientious objection) but I don't care about AI use, backend or upfront, gen or other.  <br><br>I care about a fun game and this one is adorable.<br><br>So your statement is false.<br><br>You want perform anti-AI sentiment?  Put in the effort and make a rational argument instead of presumming to speak for people you don't know.  It's just lazy, stop taking shortcuts.<br><br>Oh, and keep harrassing devs over disclosed AI use and don't be surprised when Steam rolls back on mandating it be disclosed and bans any discussion of it.			</div>
