				WTF difference does it make if they use AI or not?  I don't see you creating anything but hate on every game forum that has anything to do with AI?  Are you a game designer out of a job, I don't think so, are you an artist in need of work?  I don't think so.  So keep your nasty remarks about AI to yourself.  You and so many other losers have tried to ruin games for all the rest of us because you are living in  the 90s, not the 2020s!!			</div>
